  "scope": "Private packed text/lines storage and emitted retention coordinates. No new resource, canonical partial Value, Rust workload body, or second runtime authority.",
  "storage": [
    "The actual selected text/lines factory prepares one owning chunk store. UTF-8 payloads use packed allocations with four-byte newline offsets; cross-fragment lines grow amortized backing.",
    "Metadata, payloads, replacement coexistence and retirement use the original managed-memory account. One cumulative selected-producer compute allowance includes lookup work; no per-chunk allowance renewal.",
    "Generated carrier instructions choose the monotonic lower bound or sealed returned range. Rust validates coordinates and owns/releases backing; it does not interpret source states or headers.",
    "Only successful EOF publishes descriptive final geometry. Incomplete or failed storage never publishes a canonical String, Matrix, numeric length, output or permission."
  ],
